ot reset past this time in the  future which ensures minami is safe to  manage the powers and protect the people  of sakurata an organization called the  administration club is formed it holds  the records of every person in the town  and their abilities and uses them when  necessary for the town's benefit in the  following scene we are introduced to  arie a girl who has the ability to steal  other people's powers but cannot use it  she used to be one of kay's classmates  and used to treat him like a hero long  ago he helped her get rid of her abusive  father however they grew apart with time  and arie still holds a grudge against k  for neglecting her that day she meets an  employee from the administration club  who wants to help her to steal an old  man's power when arie hesitates the  employee asks her if she wants to be  better than kay and manipulates her into  doing it kay and haruki work for a lower  branch of the administration club called  the service club the help they provide  to people is authorized by this club  later that day kaye goes to meet the  manager of the service club he is told  about an old man named cesano whose  power was recently stolen by arie the  club appoints him to meet sasano and  help him somehow in the following scene  k and cesano are together he reveals  that he could enter into any picture for  10 minutes before arie stole his powers  but for his power to work one must tear  the picture right in front of where it  was taken how the hell did he figure  that out after the meeting kay gets a  call from the manager who tells him that  someone very important from the  administration bureau wants to meet him  and taruki urgently kay is confused  because he doesn't remember being  acquainted with anyone from the  administration club still the next day  he and haruki arrive in front of the  club's special quarter they are welcomed  by a mysterious man who refuses to  answer any questions he politely brings  him inside the building that 