odge in  order for the power to be returned after  the incident kay and haruki return to  the manager's office and meet their old  friend sakagami his power is that he can  transfer one person's ability to another  since k remembers how haruki used her  powers they hope they can transfer the  knowledge from k to haruki they go  through the procedure but when haruki  tries to reset the powers don't work  later k and haruki are returning home  when she asks him if their relationship  is going to change now that she cannot  help him anymore kay says he doesn't  know which hurts haruki since she is in  love with him after dropping her off kay  goes to meet the manager yet again and  asks him how he knows marasi the manager  is shocked but reveals that he used to  be best friends with murasi's elder  brother who died in a traffic accident a  flashback shows us that marasi the  manager and their friend had barged into  the administration's headquarters  threatening to blow up the building if  they didn't help them resurrect  morassi's brother but as expected the  help never came and mourassi became  vengeful currently her mission is to  steal the power from the witch and take  over the administration club with a more  inclusive organization this is why she  wanted a detailed map of the witch's  special lodge somewhere else the old man  cesano tears a picture of his lover from  50 years earlier when the picture comes  to life it is revealed that the woman in  the picture is the witch she was taken  away from him by the administration  bureau which ended their relationship  but neither of them have stopped loving  each other even now cesano tells the  young witch that he misses her but she  doesn't know how the older version of  herself feels about him she looks at his  future and comments that they will need  kaye's help  at home k is doing his best to make the  map as accurate as possible suddenly he  comes to a realization that if marasi is  about to steal the witch's po