 sasano and the witch are  inside having already reunited with each  other they plan to go outside the city  and leave their powers behind the movie  ends as k and the witch thank each other  this seems like a happy ending but it's  basically the equivalent of the avengers  noping off of planet earth subscribe for  more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

